        "alt": "鬣蜥龙——家长指南——如何培养好奇心",
        "url": "https://assets.tangobook.co.kr/1773898487865-%EC%97%84%EC%A7%80%EC%86%90%EA%B0%80%EB%9D%BD%EC%97%90%EB%82%A0%EC%B9%B4%EB%A1%9C%EC%9A%B4%EA%B0%80%EC%8B%9C%EB%A5%BC%EA%B0%80%EC%A7%84%EC%A0%84%EC%82%AC%EC%9D%B4%EA%B5%AC%EC%95%84%EB%85%B8%EB%8F%88-illustration-page15-1773898776471.webp",
        "text": "<h2>父母指南 — 如何培养好奇心</h2><p>抬起拇指，模仿说出“这里曾经有刺”。讲述“最初人们以为它是犀牛”这样的发现故事，就能让孩子生动地了解科学是如何不断变化的。</p>",
        "caption": "大拇指扎刺的模仿（或：假装用拇指刺）",
        "image_style": "",
        "image_prompt": "A parent and child pointing thumbs up like a thumb spike, warm children's book illustration, no text"
      }
